WEBVTT

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:06.560
What? Did you buy that?

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:07.440
Y-Y-Yeah.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:08.690
Is it HD?!

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:09.650
I-Is it recording?

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:11.320
Y-Yeah, say something.

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:12.990
Like, just say something.

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:14.950
Yay! Peace, peace!

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:15.910
Can all of you see this?

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:17.120
What do you mean, "all of you"?

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:18.870
Just felt like saying it.

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:23.250
Whoa there, mind getting my manager?

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:25.250
I cost a lot to film.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:26.630
Just kidding.

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:31.340
This is how moments that pass us by are captured.

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:35.550
W-W-Well, do that thing you guys always do!

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:36.760
Ready, go.

00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:38.220
It's starting!

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:30.380
Saber Lion, King of the Wild.

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:32.880
Saber Lion rises early in the morning.

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:35.340
Hello. I'm your host, Emiya Shirou.

00:02:35.340 --> 00:02:39.380
We have Saber-san, King of Knights, with us today as commentator.

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:41.390
Saber-san, thank you for coming.

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:42.680
Thank you for inviting me.

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:45.470
It's cute, yet majestic.

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:46.970
Because it's a king.

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:49.020
It's eating something.

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:50.600
Maybe it's hungry.

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:53.020
Kings throughout the ages have always been hungry.

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:54.650
Let's feed it Lancer.

00:02:57.650 --> 00:02:59.450
Ow...

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:00.450
Where am I?

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:04.530
W-Wait, what's this?! Stop!

00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:06.200
This is the wild, I guess.

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:07.750
The weak are grilled meat meals for the strong.

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:08.450
Huh?

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:09.160
It's nothing.

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:12.630
Anyway, is there really no need to work?

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:13.840
Who are you talking about?

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:14.500
Nothing...

00:03:14.500 --> 00:03:15.670
Is there a need to?

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:16.460
Not really...

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:23.300
Hey, hey.

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:24.180
Good, good.

00:03:24.180 --> 00:03:26.470
Food just tastes better when eaten outside!

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:28.680
I've grilled some more.

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:30.810
'Scuse me, I'd like some cold noodles.

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:34.810
Next up is an unexpected day in the King of Knights' life.

00:03:35.860 --> 00:03:38.820
Everyone! Let's start the morning meeting!

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:42.530
To stand in for the girl who's off sick with the 'flu today,

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:46.330
we've hired Saber-san as a temporary waitress.

00:03:46.620 --> 00:03:49.120
I... I'm Saber.

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:50.620
Please be kind to me.

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:53.250
K-K-King of Knights!

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:56.790
I hired her, but I can't help but bow down!

00:03:56.790 --> 00:03:59.510
Is this what Charisma rank B means?!

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:07.140
W-Welcome.

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:10.850
Saber! What the hell are you doing?!

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:12.980
The shop owner asked me to. I had no choice.

00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:15.650
Are you really going to stoop so low?

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:17.320
Isn't this a uniform?

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:20.150
Let's just leave it at that.

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:23.400
I heard the store needed help and couldn't just ignore it.

00:04:23.400 --> 00:04:24.660
Also...

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:27.950
Hmm? Someone's asking you to pay rent?

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:29.330
It's nothing.

00:04:29.330 --> 00:04:31.620
Enough talking. Let me have your order.

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:33.290
Coffee, then.

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:35.250
Hot or iced coffee?

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:36.170
Hot.

00:04:36.170 --> 00:04:36.880
Anything to eat?

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:38.460
I'm not hungry.

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:40.420
Battles can't be fought on an empty stomach!

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:41.300
What...?

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:44.300
What if you're attacked while hungry?!

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:46.680
O-Okay, I get your point.

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:48.300
Pancakes, then.

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:50.930
That can't be all someone of your stature is having.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:51.810
Geez!

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:53.140
You're so annoying!

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:55.060
Get me curry and spaghetti as well, then!

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:56.230
And dessert?

00:04:56.230 --> 00:04:57.940
Seriously...

00:04:58.230 --> 00:05:01.070
How can you fight on so little food, salaryman?!

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:02.530
That's terrible manners!

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:03.820
Look, you spilled some!

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:05.280
How lamentable!

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:07.070
Guys should be going for seconds!

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:10.950
Serving customers? More like disciplining them.

00:05:10.950 --> 00:05:13.500
Why is it so busy around here today?!

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:16.420
We've never had such high sales in Ahnenerbe's history.

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:18.290
King of Knights.

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:21.590
Please think about coming to Ahnenerbe every day to work-

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:23.800
Is that something you'd ask a king?!

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:29.510
Oh! So she really is here.

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:31.510
Not bad at all, Saber.

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:34.020
I appoint you!

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:34.980
I refuse!

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:38.480
Don't be shy, cutie.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:40.480
Please take your leave, King of Heroes.

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:43.900
Saber-san! He's a customer! A customer!

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:48.740
Alright, I'll start with some wine.

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:52.290
I'll demolish this restaurant if you serve me something poor.

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:53.700
This is a <i>café</i> .

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:54.540
I know.

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:55.870
I did it on purpose.

00:05:55.870 --> 00:05:59.040
A King of Heroes joke! Go ahead and laugh!

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:04.300
I'd slice him into two with Excalibur if I wasn't on a shift right now!

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:06.590
Hurry and get me the lunch special.

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:07.880
The full course.

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:09.180
And a smile.

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:15.980
I'm really liking this restaurant.

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:19.600
Take your reward! Take as much as you want!

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:26.240
Owner!

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:28.490
Someone ordered 666 portions!

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:30.620
Grandpa, are you about to leak?

00:06:30.620 --> 00:06:32.280
Uh, this way please.

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:33.530
Damn it, Gramps!

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:36.620
Apologies, sir.

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:38.540
We don't sell the Jump magazine here.

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:44.170
Sir, please calm down!

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:46.420
That looks bad.

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:49.430
Sorry it's so noisy, madam.

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:51.930
Don't worry about it! Keep it up!

00:06:53.010 --> 00:06:56.680
Is it really this tough to work in the service industry?

00:06:56.680 --> 00:06:58.890
Saber, the bill.

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:00.440
For my takeout...

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:03.560
I'll have you!

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:08.240
You! You! You!

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:16.740
Saber-san...

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:18.250
...pulled off her ahoge!

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:27.300
And what if I shut up and listen?

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:29.090
Customers are gods?

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:30.880
Gods are dead to me!

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:34.680
I-I don't get her at all.

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:36.640
The alternate form of Saber.

00:07:36.640 --> 00:07:38.930
So this is what they mean by "darkening".

00:07:38.930 --> 00:07:40.310
King of Heroes.

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:42.270
You haven't finished your cake.

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:46.230
It's enough that I took even one bite from cake that terrible.

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:49.070
In fact, you should be honored that I even put it in my mouth.

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:51.950
Idiot! Don't waste food!

00:07:51.950 --> 00:07:55.030
What? Are you my mom or something?!

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:59.870
I'm a cute gothic lolita maid waitress, <i>sir</i> !

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:01.040
I'm sorry.

00:08:02.460 --> 00:08:05.040
Saber-san, total respect, yo!

00:08:05.460 --> 00:08:08.300
S-Saber, you must be tired by now, right?

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:10.590
Let's go back home. Okay?

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:13.550
You think I'm tired from just this?

00:08:15.050 --> 00:08:16.720
I'd rather die than admit it!

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:18.310
That's the same as admitting it!

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:20.430
I'm just hungry.

00:08:21.430 --> 00:08:23.190
I'm going to rest for a bit.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:25.020
Give me something delicious!

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:26.770
Here!

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:31.780
H-How was it?

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:34.410
Delicious.

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:37.530
Here's more!

00:08:37.530 --> 00:08:38.660
Bring me seconds.

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:40.040
By the container-full!

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:43.120
She must normally be pretty suppressed.

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:44.040
King of Heroes.

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:44.960
Yes.

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:48.420
I'm heading out to town tonight
once my shift is over. Come with me!

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:49.550
Y-Yes.

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:51.800
So that's what this guy actually likes.

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:53.590
Even his personality changed.

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:55.720
Saber-san, that was so smooth!

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:57.430
I'll follow you for the rest of my life!

00:08:57.430 --> 00:08:59.510
I'll head out to town tonight, too!

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:05.100
There's something I can say as Neko-Chaos.

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:05.980
What?

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:10.230
Men are corrupted by darkness.

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:18.160
I learned something today.

00:09:18.530 --> 00:09:20.660
Work is worship.

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:23.160
I love you...

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:31.250
Shirou, I'm home!

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:34.920
Welcome home, Saber.

00:09:41.640 --> 00:09:43.140
You're home late.

00:09:43.140 --> 00:09:45.600
Yes, something came up...

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:47.230
Dinner's ready.

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:49.150
Or would you rather take a bath first?

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:49.690
Shirou.

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:51.820
What is it?

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:57.070
H-Happy birthday.

00:09:57.070 --> 00:10:00.200
Saber, you remembered!

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:04.160
That's because you're my Master, Shirou.

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:06.160
A pressure cooker!

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:09.000
It's the newest model I saw on TV the other day.

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:10.380
Thank you!

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:15.010
I wasn't sure what would please men of this era...

00:10:15.010 --> 00:10:15.920
Nah.

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:18.090
I'm really happy, Saber.

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:25.980
Please use it to make lots of good food!

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:02.570
This is the real thing.

00:12:02.570 --> 00:12:04.950
Next episode preview!

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:06.950
Yo, best guys out there!

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:09.240
Today's Taiga Dojo begins now!

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:13.540
What a shabby-looking place, Master.

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:14.880
Wh-Who are you?

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:17.420
Need you even ask?

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:20.590
I am the pinnacle of the arts, the flower of Olympia!

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:22.680
Mmm. In today's words...

00:12:23.630 --> 00:12:25.300
I'm Red Saber!

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:29.010
Uh... Olympiac?

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:29.770
Mmm.

00:12:29.770 --> 00:12:34.480
I heard this carnival was huge so I rushed over, but looks like I'm a step too late.

00:12:34.480 --> 00:12:35.350
How disappointing.

00:12:35.350 --> 00:12:37.770
Ah, sorry about that.

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:38.900
Mmm.

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:43.700
I didn't expect the delayed release of Extra to affect this too.

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:46.030
Uh, your clothes...

00:12:46.030 --> 00:12:47.490
Your dress is see-through.

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:49.410
Fool. It's not see-through.

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:50.740
I'm <i>letting</i> people see.

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:51.370
It's nice and cool.

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:52.870
Wow!

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:54.460
Your rear's half-exposed, too!

00:12:54.460 --> 00:12:56.750
Leave the ogling at me for later.

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:58.500
Host, go close the show.

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:00.500
Well then, best guys and girls!

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:01.670
Thank you!

00:13:01.670 --> 00:13:02.420
Mmm.

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:04.300
I don't really understand, but thank you all.

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:06.720
See you again in Season Three.

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:10.390
Fly for the moon!
